      "updated": 1773741006924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "销售额（Sales）\n统一口径：全部收进来\n- 含税、退款等先计入\n- 作为 100% 基准\n目的：先把‘发生过的业务’全算上",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "销售额（Sales）\n统一口径：全部收进来\n- 含税、退款等先计入\n- 作为 100% 基准\n目的：先把‘发生过的业务’全算上",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-03-17T09:50:20.278Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
      "syncTimestamp": "2026-03-17T09:50:20.275Z"
