      "updated": 1773741006924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "营收 / 净额（Net）\n= Sales - 需要扣减的项\n典型：退款、税/VAT、\n平台相关扣减等\n注：要能显示公式/提示框",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "营收 / 净额（Net）\n= Sales - 需要扣减的项\n典型：退款、税/VAT、\n平台相关扣减等\n注：要能显示公式/提示框",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "syncedAt": "2026-03-17T09:50:20.278Z",
      "source": "frontend_sync",
